// MOPR rules for the "DriveableSvoboda" mod.
// * SVOBODA(855kg) is a regular UnityCar vehicle (CarDynamics/Axles/Drivetrain/Rigidbody).
//   Only its car physics is paused when far away (vehiclePhysics); the object itself is never
//   switched off, so the mod's scripts and FSMs keep running.
// * The mod has two dashboard gauge objects ("l dashboard gauges(Clone)" in the drivable car and
//   "ls dashboard gauges(Clone)" in the wreck). Their names match MOP's item scanner ("dashboard"
//   + "(Clone)"), so they would be handled as loose items and vanish at distance: excluded.
{
  "mod": "DriveableSvoboda",
  "exclude": [
    "l dashboard gauges(Clone)",
    "ls dashboard gauges(Clone)"
  ],
  "manage": {
    "vehiclePhysics": [
      "SVOBODA(855kg)"
    ]
  }
}
